    "NT_VERSE_REF": "John 1:1",
    "NT_VERSE_SNIPPET": "In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was with God, and the Word was God.",
    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Genesis 1:1 — “In the beginning God created the heaven and the earth.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "John 1:1 — “In the beginning was the Word, and the Word was with God, and the Word was God.”",
    "GREEK": "Θεός",
    "GREEK_TRANSLIT": "Theos",
    "HEBREW": "אֱלֹהִים",
